# R129 Technical Data Repository

This workspace contains a searchable knowledge base for a **1991 Mercedes-Benz 500 SL** (chassis 129.066, engine M119.960, KE-Jetronic/CIS-E fuel injection, EZL ignition, 722.3 transmission, ADS I suspension).

## Quick Reference

- **Structured data** (YAML): `r129_data/data/*.yaml` -- fuses, relays, fluids, torques, known issues
- **Ingested service docs** (JSONL): `r129_data/references/chunks/all_chunks.jsonl` -- 2400+ searchable chunks from 110 factory manuals
- **Document index**: `r129_data/references/doc_index/*.yaml` -- topics and TOC per document
- **Project documentation**: see `docs/` file map in the diary-practice rule

## How to Answer R129 Technical Questions

Read the skill at `r129_data/SKILL.md` for detailed search instructions and CLI commands.

The venv is at `r129_data/.venv/` -- activate it before running CLI tools.
